  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements <br>Three Story Home<br>2nd Floor| Master, King; Guest, Queen; Guest, Queen; Guest; Twin Over Full Custom Built In Bunk Bed<br>3rd Floor | Office, Twin Futon Sleeper<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>Experience Blue Porch Paradise<br><br>Welcome to your BRAND NEW dream vacation rental in the exclusive Grande Pointe community, nestled just moments from the stunning beaches of Inlet Beach, Rosemary Beach, and the iconic 30A corridor. This newly built, custom 3-story home boasts unparalleled luxury, high-end designer finishes, and an array of exceptional amenities to ensure your stay is both relaxing and memorable.<br><br>Property Highlights:<br><br>Spacious and Stylish: Featuring 4 beautifully appointed bedrooms, 3 full bathrooms, and 2 half bathrooms, this home offers plenty of space for families or groups seeking a comfortable, upscale retreat.<br><br>Entertainer’s Paradise: The home comes with a sunroom, five expansive porches, and a back patio complete with a summer kitchen that includes a built-in BBQ grill, fridge, and a separate ice maker—ideal for entertaining or simply enjoying a quiet evening outdoors.<br><br>Work & Relax in Style: The third floor includes a dedicated office with a wet bar, creating the perfect blend of work and leisure, should you need to stay productive during your getaway.<br><br>Top-of-the-Line Kitchen: The gourmet kitchen is equipped with two coffee machines, premium cafe appliances, and a convenient separate ice maker, providing all the essentials to enjoy your stay and meals in style.<br><br>Convenient Transportation: To make exploring the local area even easier, the home comes with a brand-new 6-seat golf cart, ideal for effortlessly accessing the shops, dining, and events at 30Avenue, as well as the scenic 30A beach and coastline. The golf cart is provided by LIV Adventures, a separate agreement will be sent five days prior to arrival for you to fill out. <br><br>Whether you’re seeking a tranquil retreat or a convenient base to explore all that the 30A area has to offer, this luxury vacation home provides the perfect combination of comfort, style, and prime location. Book your stay today and indulge in a coastal escape like no other!<br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>Three Story Home<br>1st Floor—Dining Kitchen, Living, Sun Room, Half Bathroom, Mud Room, Garage, Back Patio, Summer Kitchen<br>2nd Floor—Master Bedroom, 3 Guest Bedrooms, 3 Full Bathrooms, Balcony, Screened Balcony<br>3rd Floor—Office Area, Wet Bar, Half Bathroom, Balcony<br><br>Unit Amenities- Laundry, Garage, Multiple Balconies, 6 Seat Golf Cart, Bicycles<br>*Please note that all TVs provide Smart streaming options but no cable TV.<br>Community Amenities- Private Dock, Community Pool, Clubhouse<br><br>About the Community of Grande Pointe<br>The idyllic Grande Pointe neighborhood is located between Rosemary Beach and Panama City Beach, abutting the lush greenery of Camp Helen State Park. This beachside community offers its guest a relaxing atmosphere to enjoy the beauty and tranquility of Gulf living. Grande Pointe features a heated community pool, a dock on Lake Powell, and a community pavilion featuring an amenity center and gathering space with full kitchen. While the neighborhood is a dream, you are less than a 5 minute drive away from the sugar white sands of Inlet Beach and various food options, outlet malls, and golf courses. Whether you like to spend your vacation on the shoreline or in the air conditioning, Grande Pointe has it all! Amenities such as golf, tennis, biking, boating, water sports & more are available locally at additional costs.<br> <br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
